/// The class for the vSAN physical disk health result.
///
/// ### How to access
/// - `HostVsanHealthSystem::vsan_host_query_physical_disk_health_summary().disks?[*]`
/// - `VsanClusterHealthSystem::vsan_query_cluster_physical_disk_health_summary().disks?[*]`
