/// - `ClusterComputeResource::action_history.action→ClusterClusterInitialPlacementAction.config_spec?.v_app_config?.ip_assignment?`
/// - `ClusterComputeResource::recommendation.action?[*]→ClusterClusterInitialPlacementAction.config_spec?.v_app_config?.ip_assignment?`
/// - `VirtualMachineSnapshot::config.v_app_config?.ip_assignment`
