/// - `ClusterComputeResource::recommendation.action?[*]→ClusterClusterInitialPlacementAction.config_spec?.scheduled_hardware_upgrade_info?.fault?.fault_message?[*]`
/// - `ClusterComputeResource::action_history.action→ClusterClusterInitialPlacementAction.config_spec?.tools?.last_install_info?.fault?.fault_message?[*]`
